WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:19.634
Brad: What are we going to do now!

2
00:00:19.635 --> 00:00:21.625
Tina: I see a log up ahead.

3
00:00:21.626 --> 00:00:24.547
Tina: It’s sticking out from the riverbank.

4
00:00:24.548 --> 00:00:27.085
Danny: I don’t think I can swim to it.

5
00:00:27.086 --> 00:00:28.646
Tina: Just hold onto me.

6
00:00:28.647 --> 00:00:31.282
I’m a great swimmer.

7
00:00:31.284 --> 00:00:34.536
We’re almost there!

8
00:00:34.537 --> 00:00:36.413
Danny: Good work, Tina.

9
00:00:36.414 --> 00:00:39.504
Brad: Okay, what now?

10
00:00:39.505 --> 00:00:43.719
Tina: Now we just have to crawl across to dry land over there.

11
00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:47.834
I’ll go first.

12
00:00:47.835 --> 00:00:50.768
Tina: Come on, guys! I’ll help you up!

13
00:00:50.769 --> 00:00:52.225
Brad: We’d better hurry.

14
00:00:52.226 --> 00:00:54.450
This doesn’t feel very steady.

15
00:00:54.451 --> 00:01:00.761
Danny: You first, Brad.

16
00:01:00.762 --> 00:01:05.738
Tina: Okay. Come on, Danny!

17
00:01:05.739 --> 00:01:07.400
Danny: We made it!

18
00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:11.485
Brad: Yeah, but I don’t think my computer did.

19
00:01:11.486 --> 00:01:15.656
Tina: Okay, now that we’re on dry land, what next?

20
00:01:15.657 --> 00:01:18.843
Danny: We still need to find Hopian’s land.

21
00:01:18.844 --> 00:01:20.626
Brad: But how?

22
00:01:20.627 --> 00:01:24.815
Tina: What about trying the key again?

23
00:01:24.816 --> 00:01:26.942
Danny: It’s not in great shape.

24
00:01:26.943 --> 00:01:29.959
Brad: That looks more like mud than clay.

25
00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:32.553
Tina: Try it anyway, Danny.

26
00:01:32.554 --> 00:01:38.326
Danny: Open the door, open the door . . .

27
00:01:38.327 --> 00:01:40.494
It’s not working.

28
00:01:40.495 --> 00:01:44.332
Brad: You do have other colors of clay, Danny.

29
00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:46.054
Tina: Good idea, Brad!

30
00:01:46.055 --> 00:01:49.471
Try to make another key, Danny.

31
00:01:49.472 --> 00:01:52.492
Danny: Which color should I use?

32
00:01:52.493 --> 00:01:53.500
Tina: Red.

33
00:01:53.501 --> 00:01:59.103
Tina: Because I’m wet and cold, and red reminds me of somewhere warm.

34
00:01:59.104 --> 00:02:03.606
Danny: Well, the blue key did lead us to a land of water.

35
00:02:03.607 --> 00:02:07.264
Danny: I guess the red key might lead us somewhere warm.

36
00:02:07.265 --> 00:02:10.934
Danny: Okay, here goes . . .

37
00:02:10.935 --> 00:02:17.646
Danny: Done! Now I have to concentrate like last time. Ready?

38
00:02:17.647 --> 00:02:23.858
Danny: Take us to Ginormous, take us to Ginormous, take us to Ginormous.

39
00:02:23.859 --> 00:02:25.474
Danny: Is it working?

40
00:02:25.475 --> 00:02:30.069
Tina: Not yet. Concentrate harder, Danny!

41
00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:32.514
Brad: Danny is concentrating hard.

42
00:02:32.515 --> 00:02:35.923
I almost wish he takes us home.

43
00:02:35.924 --> 00:02:40.491
Tina: Oh, Brad! We need to help the giants. Remember?

44
00:02:40.492 --> 00:02:42.227
Brad: I know, I know.

45
00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:44.263
I’m just cold and tired.

46
00:02:44.264 --> 00:02:47.244
I don’t really mean it.

47
00:02:47.245 --> 00:02:48.865
Tina: I know you don’t.

48
00:02:48.866 --> 00:02:51.089
I’m tired too.

49
00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:55.196
Brad: Hey! Something’s happening!

50
00:02:55.197 --> 00:03:02.408
Tina: Look, something is coming out of the ground!

51
00:03:02.409 --> 00:03:03.786
Danny: It worked!

52
00:03:03.787 --> 00:03:05.828
Tina: Way to go, Danny!

53
00:03:05.829 --> 00:03:09.098
Brad: This door looks more inviting than the first door.

54
00:03:09.099 --> 00:03:13.758
Danny: Let’s open it and find out!
